'''Pearl''' is a [[Godly Weapons|godly]] knife that was originally obtainable by purchasing the [[Pearl Gamepass]] for 1,699 Robux or the [[Pearls Bundle]] for 3,399 Robux in the [[Summer Event 2024]] or through trading.

== Appearance ==
It mainly resembles an [[Eternal]], but with the bottom part of the blade being thinner instead of larger. The outer blade is a light blue with slight magenta/purple fading, while the inner part is an electric blue with light blue stripes, mainly made to resemble the ocean. The handle is blue and seems to have a pearl at the center of it. Lastly, the pomnel is light blue and has a triangular Shape. It has an likely oceanish design.

== Trivia ==
* It partners with the [[Godly Weapons|godly]] gun [[Pearlshine]], making the [[Murder Mystery 2 Wiki:Wiki-Bot/Pearl Set|Pearl Set]].
* This and its partner gun are two of the ten gamepass weapons where you had the option to buy them as part of a bundle or separately, the others being [[Flowerwood]], [[Flowerwood Gun|Flowerwood gun]], [[Darkshot]], [[Darksword]], [[Waves]], [[Ocean]], [[Rainbow (Godly)|Rainbow]], [[Rainbow Gun (Godly)|Rainbow Gun]], [[Sakura]], [[Blossom]], [[Phantom]], [[Spectre]], [[Plasmablade]], [[Plasmabeam]], [[Iceflake]], and [[Icebeam]].
* This and its partner gun are two of the six summer-themed godlies, the others being [[Watergun]], [[Chroma Watergun]], [[Waves]] and [[Ocean]].

